# Drizzle — the entire migrations/ folder (SQL + meta journal & snapshots) MUST be
# versioned: drizzle-kit migrate needs meta/_journal.json to know what to apply, and
# generate needs the snapshots to diff schema changes. Do NOT ignore meta/.

# Claude — ignore everything inside .claude/ except team reference docs
.claude/*
!.claude/ARCHITECTURE.md
!.claude/ROADMAP.md
!.claude/current_state.md
